      <div>
        <span class="section-index">01 / Telecommunications</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3">Fibre Optic Rollout</h2>
        <p class="lead mt-3">Narrow trenches, fast advance speed, minimal surface damage. LIBA cutters work steadily day after day, achieving up to 1,000 metres of fibre optic route per day — economically superior to excavators and cut-off saws.</p>
        <ul class="spec-list">
          <li><span class="num">01</span><div><strong>Recommended models</strong><span>GM 600 R · GM 4 Crawler · GM 450 H · GM 180 AF</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="num">02</span><div><strong>Route geometry</strong><span>Cut widths from 80 mm — precise and reproducible.</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="num">03</span><div><strong>Daily output</strong><span>Up to 1,000 linear metres in advance (ground-dependent).</span></div></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="media-frame"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/applications/glasfaser.webp" alt="" width="1536" height="1152"><span class="tag">FTTH · FTTB · Backbone</span></div>
    </div>

    <hr class="divider">

    <div id="pipeline" class="split align-start reverse reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="section-index">02 / Utilities</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3">Pipeline &amp; Pipe Installation</h2>
        <p class="lead mt-3">Gas, water, sewage, district heating — precise trenches for safe utility routes with defined walls and a stable bed.</p>
        <ul class="spec-list">
          <li><span class="num">01</span><div><strong>Recommended models</strong><span>GM 180 AF · GM 140 AFH-600 · GM 6 ASR</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="num">02</span><div><strong>Cutting depth</strong><span>Up to 1,800 mm, optionally with installation and backfill equipment.</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="num">03</span><div><strong>Pipe sizes</strong><span>DN 50 — DN 600, configurable.</span></div></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="media-frame"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/applications/rohrleitungsbau.jpg" alt="" width="1024" height="768"><span class="tag">DN 50 — DN 600</span></div>
    </div>

