    <div id="kabel" class="split align-start reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="section-index">03 / Energy</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3">Power &amp; Solar Cable Routes</h2>
        <p class="lead mt-3">Earth cable installation for solar parks, wind farms and medium-voltage networks. A LIBA cutter turns weeks of excavator work into a few days of planned, predictable progress.</p>
        <ul class="spec-list">
          <li><span class="num">01</span><div><strong>Recommended models</strong><span>GM 4 All-Wheel · GM 4 Crawler · GMV 130 vibrating plough</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="num">02</span><div><strong>Simultaneous installation</strong><span>Cutting + cable laying + backfilling in a single pass.</span></div></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="media-frame"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/applications/kabelverlegung.jpg" alt="" width="1024" height="768"><span class="tag">PV · Wind · Medium voltage</span></div>
    </div>

    <hr class="divider">

    <div id="drainage" class="split align-start reverse reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="section-index">04 / Sports &amp; Drainage</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3">Sports Field Construction &amp; Drainage</h2>
        <p class="lead mt-3">Drainage trenches in natural and artificial turf installations — precise, narrow and with minimal damage to the playing surface. Also proven on golf courses and equestrian arenas.</p>
        <ul class="spec-list">
          <li><span class="num">01</span><div><strong>Recommended models</strong><span>GM 4 All-Wheel · GM 450 H · GM 180 AF · GM 300 HF</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="num">02</span><div><strong>Surface protection</strong><span>Minimal rutting, rapid reinstatement.</span></div></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="media-frame"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/applications/sportplatzbau.jpg" alt="" width="1024" height="768"><span class="tag">Natural turf · Artificial turf · Golf</span></div>
    </div>

    <hr class="divider">

    <div id="landwirtschaft" class="split align-start reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="section-index">05 / Agriculture</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3">Agriculture &amp; Irrigation</h2>
        <p class="lead mt-3">Drainage and irrigation trenches for fields, plantations and vineyards — matched to the farm tractor and the demands of the agricultural season.</p>
        <ul class="spec-list">
          <li><span class="num">01</span><div><strong>Recommended models</strong><span>GMV 100 plough · GM 180 AF · GM 1800 P · GMV 130</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="num">02</span><div><strong>Attachment</strong><span>Standard three-point linkage for common tractors.</span></div></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="media-frame"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/applications/landwirtschaft.jpg" alt="" width="1024" height="768"><span class="tag">Drainage · Irrigation</span></div>
