        <span class="section-index">06 / Special Construction</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3">Mining, Rock &amp; Track Construction</h2>
        <p class="lead mt-3">Where excavators reach their limits, LIBA is just getting started. Extremely hard ground, rocky subsoil, confined conditions alongside railway tracks.</p>
        <ul class="spec-list">
          <li><span class="num">01</span><div><strong>Recommended models</strong><span>GM 6 ASR rock cutter · GM 4 All-Wheel · GM 140 AFH-600</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="num">02</span><div><strong>Tooling</strong><span>Tungsten carbide picks, customer-specifically configurable.</span></div></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
